      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/beacon_iowa",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1894, Beacon miners joined the United Mine Workers, forming local 178, a key labor milestone.",
